## Anti-Patterns Avoided

- ❌ **Full border + `border-l-2`** on the same element — conflicting widths. Used `border-l-2` + `rounded-r-md` only.
- ❌ **Color-only status** — accent bar always paired with icon + badge text.
- ❌ **Dumping raw JSON into the summary** — one-line, whitespace-collapsed, truncated values with `title` tooltip for the full string.

## Accessibility Checklist

- [x] Toggles expose `aria-expanded`.
- [x] Values that are visually truncated keep the full content in `title`; full JSON remains in the details `<pre>`.
- [x] No meaning conveyed by color alone.
- [x] Text sizes kept at `10–12px` only for metadata/chips, tool name stays `12px` semibold mono.
- [x] Error message is real text (not an icon-only indicator), `line-clamp-2` with `break-all`.

