## Notes / Trade-offs

- **Sticky offset is tied to the entry header height.** `ChatEntry.vue`'s header is `sticky top-0 z-20` with `btn-xs` content, `pb-1.5` (`@lg/panel:pb-3`) and `-mt-1` → 27px (narrow) / 33px (wide). If that header padding or button size ever changes, update `top-[27px] @lg/panel:top-[33px]` in one place. If the narrow header wraps to two lines, a ~24px gap can appear — say the word and I'll replace the magic numbers with a CSS variable set by the header (`--entry-header-h`).
